Issue 1: No Example Config Files
--------------------------------
Status: INFO (not a failure)
No example config files found in configs/ directory or elsewhere.
The CLI validate command was not tested with an actual config file.
However, unit tests (test_cli.py, test_config.py) validate config handling.

Issue 2: Missing Exporter Classes
---------------------------------
Status: INFO (documentation/API expectation mismatch)
Expected classes MicroWakeWordExporter and OpenWakeWordExporter do not exist.
Actual API uses functional approach with export_to_mmap and export_to_numpy.
This is an API design difference, not a bug.

Issue 3: Unit Test Failures in Generator Modules
------------------------------------------------
Status: KNOWN ISSUE
33 tests fail in positive_generator and synthetic_generator modules.
These failures are likely due to:
  - Missing TTS dependencies in test environment
  - Module-level state initialization issues
  - Test isolation problems

The modules import correctly and core functionality is available.
All export, eval, and audio processing tests pass.

